WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:05.259
They acted like old college buddies.

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:09.870
These two men are - for many here - the pariahs
of this G20 summit.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:15.349
President Vladimir Putin is in hot water over
Russia's seizure of Ukrainian ships after

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:19.600
a clash in the Black Sea.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.540
Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman, meanwhile,
is accused of ordering the murder of dissident

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.840
Saudi journalist Jamal Khashoggi in Istanbul.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:34.370
Saudi Arabia says the Crown Prince had no
role in it, the CIA says he did...

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:39.460
... and US President Donald Trump disagrees
with his own intelligence agency.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.260
Trump denied talking with the man known as
MBS.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:47.910
Reporter: "Mr President, what did you discuss
with MBS?"

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:51.050
Trump: "We had no discussion.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.560
We had no discussion.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.270
We might but we had none."

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:59.890
Earlier, at the traditional family photo,
the Crown Prince cut something of an isolated

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:00.940
figure.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.710
Nobody wanting to shake his hand.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:08.370
When it came to the clicking of cameras, Bin
Salman was on the edge of the frame.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:12.780
France's Emmanuel Macron was later said to
have given him some firm words.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.930
He can probably expect a few more by the end
of the summit.

